.* USERHELP: the Operational Assistant menu for information and problems.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='USERHELP'.
:IMPORT NAME=DSCJOB PNLGRP=QHWMCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=DSPWSUSR PNLGRP=QHWCCMD.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS HELP='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.F1=Help
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION='CMD CALL QCMD'.F9=Command line
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=USERHELP HELP=HLPUSERHELP KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Information and Problem Handling
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.To select one of the following, type its number below and press Enter:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='HELP HLPUSEHELP' HELP='USERHELP/OPT1'.How to use help
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='MENU INFO' HELP='USERHELP/OPT2'.Information Assistant options
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD DSPWSUSR' HELP=DSPWSUSR.Display work station user
:MENUI OPTION=10 ACTION='CMD ?SAVAPARDTA' HELP='USERHELP/OPT10'.Save information to help resolve a problem
:MENUI OPTION=11 ACTION='MENU TECHHELP' HELP='USERHELP/OPT11'.Technical support tasks
:MENUI OPTION=80 ACTION='CMD DSCJOB' HELP=DSCJOB.Temporary sign-off
:EMENU.
:BOTINST.Type a menu option below
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPUSERHELP.Information and Problem Handling - Help
:P.Where to find help, who is signed on at this display, and the tasks that
gather what a problem report needs.
:P.Type an option number and press Enter. F9 opens a command line, F3
leaves the menu and F12 returns to the one before it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPUSEHELP.How to Use Help
:P.Press F1 or the Help key anywhere for help about the place the cursor is
on: a field, an option, a function key or the message on the bottom
line. With the cursor elsewhere, the help is about the whole display.
:P.In a help window, F2 shows the help for the whole display, Page Down and
Page Up move through a long text, F12 closes the window and F3 leaves
help altogether.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F1=Help
:PD.Shows help for where the cursor is.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F9=Command line
:PD.Shows a command line to run a command from.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='USERHELP/OPT1'.How to use help
:P.Option 1. Shows help&colon. How to use help.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='USERHELP/OPT2'.Information Assistant options
:P.Option 2. Shows menu INFO&colon. Information Assistant options.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='USERHELP/OPT10'.Save information to help resolve a problem
:P.Option 10. Runs the SAVAPARDTA command&colon. Save information to
help resolve a problem.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='USERHELP/OPT11'.Technical support tasks
:P.Option 11. Shows menu TECHHELP&colon. Technical support tasks.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
